        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn AZC203, Stainless Steel Simplicity Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p> \r\nThe clean lines of this Acorn cabinet knob look more basic than a traditionally styled cabinet knob yet boring isn't a word that comes to mind while describing it. Sophisticated in design, this cabinet handle is a great way to add a cosmopolitan side to any home without looking as sterile as other contemporary designs can. This Simplicity stainless steel cabinet knob is a perfect example of how modern design doesn't have to focus on function rather than form. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/3-inch-simplicity-stainless-steel-cabinet-pull-acorn-azc-204-3\"><b>Simplicity Stainless Steel Cabinet Knobs</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b>  for the Acorn Absolute Zero Collection Simplicity Stainless Steel Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material:  Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Diameter: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Available in polished stainless steel or brushed stainless steel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
